
### 1. Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### 2. Get first page
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/dictionary/words?page=0&size=10

### 3. Search words
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/dictionary/words?search=app&page=0&size=10

### 4. Exact word lookup
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/dictionary/words/exact?word=apple

### 5. Word detail - replace ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/dictionary/words/1

### 6. Not found
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/dictionary/words/999999999

### 7. Invalid pagination
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/dictionary/words?page=-1&size=10

### 8. Invalid page size
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/dictionary/words?page=0&size=1000
